<title>FRANCE: Schneider nine month sales rise 3.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Schneider nine month sales rise 3.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 45,639    vs   44,084</p>
<p>     Schneider Electric			  32,580    vs   31,301</p>
<p>     Spie Batignolle			     12,735    vs   12,374</p>
<p>     Others					     424    vs	510</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the sales figures in a statement. It said that based on a like-for-like basis the increase would have been 2.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
